    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Overview\n\nWhen any lead source POSTs to `/leads/ingest` (Facebook Lead Ads, Google Lead Forms, Typeform, Tally, Jotform, website forms, chat widgets), this workflow:\n\n1. Normalizes payload fields across sources\n2. Validates required fields + builds a SHA-256 fingerprint\n3. Checks HubSpot for existing contact (deduplication)\n4. Enriches via Clearbit (company, industry, size, LinkedIn)\n5. Runs AI Lead Qualification Agent (BANT + ICP scoring)\n6. Filters spam (auto-flag at likelihood > 0.6)\n7. Routes to Hot / Warm / Cold branches\n8. Creates HubSpot contact + deal (Hot), updates HubSpot (Warm/Cold)\n9. Sends Slack alerts and WhatsApp messages (Hot)\n10. Sends Gmail welcome with Calendly link (Hot) or nurture (Warm/Cold)\n11. Backs up record to Google Sheets + Airtable analytics\n12. Returns JSON summary back to the originating webhook\n\nError recovery: invalid leads → Sheets + Slack alert. Duplicates → update + log. Spam → tagged + logged. HubSpot / WhatsApp / Slack failures don't crash the workflow (`continueOnFail: true`).",
        "height": 728,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "9b1eb850-9f21-4e99-8515-c80d4df28a9b",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1392,
        976
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Node-by-node Purpose\n\n1. **Lead Webhook Trigger** (POST `/leads/ingest`) — single endpoint for every source\n2. **Normalize Lead Fields** (Set) — maps snake_case / camelCase / PascalCase field variants to a flat schema\n3. **Validate + Build Fingerprint** (Code) — checks email + name/company, computes SHA-256 fingerprint for dedup\n4. **IF Lead Valid?** — invalid leads drop to error logger\n5. **Format Invalid Lead Error → Log to Sheets → Slack Ops Alert** — records and notifies\n6. **HubSpot - Search Contact** — looks up by email for dedup\n7. **IF Duplicate?** — true: tag + update + log; false: continue\n8. **Enrich Lead (Clearbit)** — HTTP GET for company, industry, size, LinkedIn\n9. **Merge Enrichment + Lead** (Set) — joins enriched data back onto the lead record\n10. **OpenAI Chat Model** (`gpt-4o-mini`, JSON mode) — the LLM\n11. **Structured Output Parser** — JSON schema enforced (`quality_score`, `tier`, `intent`, `urgency`, `budget_signal`, `spam_likelihood`, `is_spam`, `summary`, `talking_points`, etc.)\n12. **AI Lead Qualification Agent** (Basic LLM Chain) — applies BANT + ICP heuristics\n13. **Extract AI Output** (Code) — flattens AI fields onto lead, derives tier from score\n14. **IF Spam?** — true: log to Spam_Rejections sheet; false: continue\n15. **Switch: Lead Tier** — splits Hot / Warm / Cold into parallel branches\n16. **HubSpot Upsert (each tier)** — creates contact with tier-specific lifecycle stage and properties\n17. **HubSpot Create Deal (Hot only)** — opens an `appointmentscheduled` deal\n18. **Slack: Hot Lead Alert / Marketing Nurture** — notifies correct channel\n19. **WhatsApp: Greet Hot Lead** — template-message greeting via Meta WhatsApp Business\n20. **Gmail: Calendly Welcome / Nurture Email** — sends personalized email with Calendly link\n21. **Merge → Google Sheets Backup → Airtable Analytics → Webhook Response** — final sink + analytics + HTTP reply",
        "height": 948,
        "width": 568,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "6407aec4-2ad9-41f2-9374-354cfeaf1195",
      "name": "Note: Node-by-node",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        7456,
        832
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"quality_score\": { \"type\": \"number\", \"description\": \"Overall lead quality 0-100 based on ICP fit + intent + urgency\" },\n    \"tier\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"Hot\", \"Warm\", \"Cold\"], \"description\": \"Hot=75+, Warm=50-74, Cold<50\" },\n    \"intent\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"What the lead wants (1 sentence)\" },\n    \"urgency\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"immediate\", \"this_week\", \"this_month\", \"no_timeline\"], \"description\": \"When they want to act\" },\n    \"budget_signal\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"explicit_budget\", \"implicit_budget\", \"no_budget_signal\"], \"description\": \"Detected budget indicator\" },\n    \"spam_likelihood\": { \"type\": \"number\", \"description\": \"0.0 to 1.0 — probability this is junk\" },\n    \"is_spam\": { \"type\": \"boolean\", \"description\": \"Whether to reject (true if spam_likelihood > 0.6)\" },\n    \"industry\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Inferred industry\" },\n    \"recommended_assignee\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Best-fit rep by expertise/region, e.g. alice_enterprise, bob_smb, carol_apac\" },\n    \"follow_up_priority\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"P0_immediate\", \"P1_today\", \"P2_this_week\", \"P3_nurture\"], \"description\": \"How fast to follow up\" },\n    \"summary\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"3-sentence CRM-ready lead brief for the sales rep\" },\n    \"talking_points\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }, \"description\": \"3 personalized opening bullets\" },\n    \"rejection_reason\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"If is_spam true: short reason; else empty\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"quality_score\", \"tier\", \"intent\", \"urgency\", \"spam_likelihood\", \"is_spam\", \"summary\"]\n}"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
